        <mxCell id="bid-rules" value="Raising Bids and Refunds&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Raising your own bid still requires the full new amount. The old amount becomes your pending balance; it is not deducted automatically.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Only the current highest bidder may withdraw the active bid. Superseded bids are already pending funds.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Withdrawing a bid does not send ETH to the wallet." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#162b42;strokeWidth=1.6;shape=note;size=18;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#f6f8fb;strokeColor=#c5d1df;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1">
